      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791004772286,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Drawn from haipipe-workbench-task/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent.\nA run's Result is written only by its Ticket; a judging run names a different agent from the one that made the thing.\nGuide, shared by every workbench, holds the method and the papers: Related Paper → Add a paper (haipipe-discovery).",
      "originalText": "Drawn from haipipe-workbench-task/ref/workbench-table.md. The number is the order inside a Space; · marks a view with no run; * marks a planned skill or agent.\nA run's Result is written only by its Ticket; a judging run names a different agent from the one that made the thing.\nGuide, shared by every workbench, holds the method and the papers: Related Paper → Add a paper (haipipe-discovery).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
